{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whisper Of Anima is a collaboration by university students from <strong>Chiang Mai University</strong>, created as part of a learning experience to test and improve our teamwork and development skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel free to share your thoughts and feedback</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will explore locations to search for materials needed to seal the Exorcist's Pot, gathering all the Exorcist's Pot at the final destination. Then, perform the final sealing and escape. However, ghosts will chase and try to stop you along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Isometric view</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning low-poly 3D</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic elements (Procedural\u00a0generated  levels)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cute character</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini\u00a0rhythm gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short playtime</strong> : <strong>20-30 minute</strong> (2 main story levels, procedural\u00a0generated  levels)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422930?t=1745575146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422930?t=1745575146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422930/127494ae854a57c8c0fc79d4a6b3943080b78e95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745575146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422930/127494ae854a57c8c0fc79d4a6b3943080b78e95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745575146","